# scripts/ci/*-test.sh self-tests that no workflow and not scripts/dev/verify.sh
# runs, read by scripts/ci/check-selftest-runners.sh.
#
# Format: one basename per line; `#` starts a comment.
#
# Each entry is debt, not an exemption: the gate fails on a self-test missing
# from this list AND on an entry that has since been wired or deleted, so the
# list only shrinks. To retire an entry, make the self-test pass, invoke it from
# ci.yml's import-checks job and from verify.sh, and delete its line here.

